[Event "Petrov: retreat after d6"]
[LineId "petrov-main"]
[OpeningGroup "sidelines"]
[Summary "Structure: both e-pawns disappear, leaving balanced d4/d5 pawns; ...d6 gains a tempo before ...Nxe4. Plan: develop, castle and challenge Ne4 without chasing material; distinguish this from the immediate mirror capture."]
