[Event "Petrov: the premature mirror capture"]
[LineId "petrov-trick"]
[OpeningGroup "sidelines"]
[Summary "Pattern: 3...Nxe4 4.Qe2 attacks Ne4 and prepares discovered check on e8; 4...Nf6 allows 5.Nc6+ and Nxd8. Plan: consolidate safely after winning material; Black can try 4...Qe7, so queen loss is not forced against every defense."]
